license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open research workspace connecting Unicode Tangut characters, source-cited
  dictionary senses, manuscript alignment records and explicitly unadopted
  hypotheses. Software is MIT-licensed; original annotations and documentation
  are CC BY 4.0. Unicode data and Noto fonts retain their upstream licenses.
  Initial records are AI-assisted and have not received independent expert review.
keywords:
  - Tangut
  - lexicography
